<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Exam Form Fillup Successful</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f6f8;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    }
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .header h2 {
      color: #2c3e50;
    }
    .content {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #555;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .info-box {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .info-box p {
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
    .button {
      display: block;
      width: fit-content;
      margin: 25px auto;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      background-color: #2563eb;
      color: #fff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #999;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>🎓 Exam Form Fillup Successful</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear <strong><%= studentName %></strong>,</p>

      <p>
        Your exam form fill-up has been successfully completed. Below are your details:
      </p>

      <div class="info-box">
        <p><strong>Exam:</strong> <%= examName %> (<%= examYear %>)</p>
        <p><strong>Class:</strong> <%= className %></p>
        <p><strong>Roll:</strong> <%= classRoll %></p>
      </div>

      <p>
        You can download your admit card by clicking the button below:
      </p>

      <a href="<%= admitCardUrl %>" class="button">
        📄 Download Admit Card
      </a>

      <p>
        Please keep your admit card safe and bring it during the examination.
      </p>

      <p>
        Best of luck for your exam! ✨
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>© <%= currentYear %> Your School. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>